# Routing & layouts (target state)

## Three trees

Public/bowler (`UserLayout`), `/director` (`TournamentDirectorLayout`), `/admin` (`AdminLayout`). Shared pages must respect the **active prefix**, not hardcode `/director/...`.

## Always prefer

- `getRoleAwarePath` / `useRoleAwareNavigation` / `getEventPath` from `src/utils/roleBasedRouting.ts`
- Layout prefix derived once from `location.pathname` (or a small shared hook)

## Avoid

- Raw `navigate('/rounds/...')` or duplicated absolute paths for the wrong role
- Growing `App.tsx` with more static imports - extract route config and **lazy-load** heavy trees (admin, event flow + React Flow, side actions, large event workspaces)
- New parallel auth entrypoints for e2e (use director session mocks)

## Bowler view

Honor `?view=bowler` and existing redirect helpers (`DashboardRouter`, etc.) when changing navigation. Do not break role dashboards when adding links.
